          time: 'Evening',
          icon: '🌙',
          title: 'Golden Hour & Farewell',
          text: 'End the day watching the golden hour transform the landscape. The evening light at Pamukkale is spectacular and worth waiting for. Find a local restaurant for dinner — local specialties at honest prices.',
