          tip: 'Many visitors stay only for a day trip from Denizli city — staying in Pamukkale village means having the site to yourself at dusk and dawn. Accommodation is simple but atmospheric.',
        },
      ],
    },
    {
      num: 2,
      title: 'Antique Pool Swim & Laodikeia Ancient City',
      periods: [
        {
          time: 'Morning',
          icon: '🌅',
          title: 'Cleopatra\'s Antique Pool — Swimming Among Roman Columns',
